      "cooked": "<p>Near Mint.</p>\n<p>As bad as Iron Legacy is, Surprise Shopping Spree was exceptionally painful, bringing my heroes down to critical health just as they were ready to launch an offensive. In my second game, I had characters skip turns until I could have Surprise Shopping Spree removed. Bunker and Chrono-Ranger still went down, but they were really only around to remove ongoing cards, which Bunker does whether he’s conscious or not. Otherwise, Tachyon stockpiled her cards and everyone backed her play until she could burst Iron Legacy down.</p>",
