      "created_at": "2022-10-26T22:58:35.201Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I somehow made it through with a very comfortable Mint. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> You’re given a lot of options from the start to clear Iron Legs’ board, and then he just doesn’t put up much of a fight. I might’ve lost Bunker, but who didn’t see that coming.</p>",
