      "created_at": "2022-10-27T01:03:41.009Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I screwed this one up incredibly badly, starting with discarding Bunker’s Mode because I didn’t remember how Locomotion works, and with my worst mistake being an Experiment on Parse where I revealed Impossible Shot and Targeting Arrow, and played them <em>in that order</em>.  So no Mint of course; we’ll see what happens on try 2, whenever I feel like being thrashed that hard again.</p>",
